{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17111660","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17111660","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1711166001:1":{"text":"我好像……做了一个很漫长的梦。","source_cn":"我好像……做了一个很漫长的梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63E7ACE8B3B8C3AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1711166002:1":{"text":"梦中，我一直在一片无边无际的黑雾里不断坠落。","source_cn":"梦中，我一直在一片无边无际的黑雾里不断坠落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE5469817F5CB05D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1711166003:1":{"text":"我听见你、奥利安和佩吉在光亮的地方呼唤我，我拼命朝你们跑去，却怎么也无法穿透那层迷雾拉近距离。","source_cn":"我听见你、奥利安和佩吉在光亮的地方呼唤我，我拼命朝你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC60E5EDE4225E745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1711166004:1":{"text":"此时此刻，我仍在梦中吗？","source_cn":"此时此刻，我仍在梦中吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D4023ED141EBB10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1711166005:1":{"text":"不……马克西姆，这不是梦。握紧我的手，感受它。","source_cn":"不……马克西姆，这不是梦。握紧我的手，感受它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA47BF4042EAAD722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1711166006:1":{"text":"你的手……为什么这么凉？","source_cn":"你的手……为什么这么凉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1875C85DA5E96F89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1711166007:1":{"text":"莫德琳……你失言了。你曾答应过我，无论发生什么都会照顾好自己，可你现在的样子……简直比我还要虚弱。","source_cn":"莫德琳……你失言了。你曾答应过我，无论发生什么都会照顾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C35AA4F2A91E6B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1711166008:1":{"text":"但这份温度，这份触感，皆为真实。我把你从黑雾里拉回来了。","source_cn":"但这份温度，这份触感，皆为真实。我把你从黑雾里拉回来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0D87B78B4675591","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1711166009:1":{"text":"这里也不是说话的地方，马克西姆，我们先回你的寝殿吧。","source_cn":"这里也不是说话的地方，马克西姆，我们先回你的寝殿吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6FD68ABC252C4FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1711166010:1":{"text":"你刚刚苏醒，身体依然需要休息。","source_cn":"你刚刚苏醒，身体依然需要休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x496E92A79ED0A290","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1711166011:1":{"text":"之后，我会把这段时间发生的一切，包括我所做的事，全都毫无保留地告诉你。","source_cn":"之后，我会把这段时间发生的一切，包括我所做的事，全都毫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF026B8D3FA3F5D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:国王马克西姆":{"text":"国王马克西姆","source":"国王马克西姆","status":"source"},"speaker:王后":{"text":"王后","source":"王后","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":2}}